## Benchmarks

### Phase 1 — MMLU (5-shot)

Run this phase first.

### Phase 2 — 9-Task Evaluation

* ARC-Easy
* ARC-Challenge
* BoolQ
* GSM8K
* HellaSwag
* OpenBookQA
* PIQA
* WinoGrande
* MBPP

### Old Tasks (Retention Evaluation)

* mmlu
* arc_easy
* arc_challenge
* boolq
* hellaswag
* piqa

### New Tasks (Fine-Tuning)

* gsm8k
* mbpp
* openbookqa
* winogrande

---

## Setup (HPC)

```bash
cd tiny-llm-survey

python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate

pip install -e .
```

---

## Quick Smoke Test

```bash
python -m tiny_llm_survey.cli mmlu --model qwen3-0.6b --limit 50

python -m tiny_llm_survey.cli baseline \
  --model qwen3-0.6b \
  --limit 50

python -m tiny_llm_survey.cli latency \
  --model qwen3-0.6b
```

---

## Run the Pipeline

### Phase 1: MMLU (5-shot)

Run this first.

```bash
python -m tiny_llm_survey.cli mmlu --model all
```

### Phase 2: 9-Task Baseline

```bash
python -m tiny_llm_survey.cli baseline --model all
```

### Phase 3: Latency

```bash
python -m tiny_llm_survey.cli latency --model all
```

### Phase 4: Training

```bash
python -m tiny_llm_survey.cli train \
  --model qwen3-0.6b \
  --method-config configs/training/lora_m.yaml
```

### Phase 5: Forgetting Evaluation

```bash
python -m tiny_llm_survey.cli forgetting \
  --model qwen3-0.6b \
  --training-run results/training/qwen3-0.6b__lora_m
```

### Phase 6: Generate Blog Assets

```bash
python -m tiny_llm_survey.cli aggregate
```

---

## SLURM

```bash
sbatch slurm/submit_mmlu.slurm

sbatch slurm/submit_baseline.slurm

export MODEL=qwen3-0.6b
export METHOD_CONFIG=configs/training/lora_m.yaml

sbatch slurm/submit_train.slurm
```

---

## Merge LoRA Adapters Before Evaluation

```bash
python scripts/merge_lora.py \
  --model qwen3-0.6b \
  --adapter-dir results/training/qwen3-0.6b__lora_m/adapter \
  --output-dir results/training/qwen3-0.6b__lora_m/merged
```

---

## Outputs

* Raw experiment results are written to `results/`.
* Blog-ready CSV files and plots are generated in `blog_assets/`.
